    "text": "kmaland.com\nwebsite\nWoodbine\nKMAland Summer Football Preview No. 5: Woodbine Tigers\nBy Trevor Maeder,\n7 hours ago(Woodbine) -- KMA Sports is checking in with several KMAland football programs this summer, as they prepare for the 2025 season. Up next is the Woodbine Tigers. Coach Dustin Crook's program is coming off its second consecutive winning season and best season in the Bound era. Woodbine had an 8-2 campaign in 2024. They beat East Mills for the program's playoff win since their 1997 state runner-up squad before losing to Audubon in the second round.",
